37,0.36,0.255,0.744,0.611,0.5,0.531,0.436,0.28,0.113,0.044,0.415,0.347,0.283,0.214,0.209,0.236,0.184,0.177,0.214,0.164,0.166,0.158,0.172,0.195,0.207,0.221,0.185,0.163,0.145,0.119,0.073,0.063,0.032],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: An aircast episode, an inquiry, and 2 days later, Inspector Cye Snopes finds his partner staring pensively at a non-descript wall within Park Pailte.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":10.432,"end":20.256,"frac":0.846,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":26},"large":{"start":10.432,"end":20.256,"frac":0.808,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"CYE: Martine? Martinnnnne…Excuse me, fair lady, I seem to have lost my partner. Usually found at her desk, a wizard of files and blast-rods, and an amazing bakestress to boot.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":20.992,"end":31.968,"frac":0.906,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":32},"large":{"start":20.992,"end":31.968,"frac":0.969,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"NARRATOR: Martine flinches at his approach, clearly not expecting him.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":32.416,"end":36.192,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"large":{"start":32.416,"end":36.192,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"MARTINE: … Usually I’m the one tracking you like a puppy. Bring any treats to bribe me with?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":36.704,"end":42.528,"frac":0.824,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":17},"large":{"start":36.704,"end":41.568,"frac":0.941,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":17},"differ":true},{"i":4,"text":"CYE: …eheh, not today I’m afraid. You were away from your desk – why take a break all the way out here?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":43.2,"end":48.448,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"large":{"start":42.304,"end":48.448,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"differ":true},{"i":5,"text":"MARTINE: Did you notice that guy is always here?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":48.8,"end":50.784,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":48.8,"end":50.784,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"NARRATOR: She inclines her head at a man leaning against the wall down the way. There’s a small paperback in his hands.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":51.232,"end":57.1,"frac":0.955,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":22},"large":{"start":51.232,"end":56.98,"frac":0.955,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":22},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"MARTINE: And this wall – when you stand at this angle, doesn’t it almost seem to shimmer?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":57.6,"end":63.328,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":16},"large":{"start":57.6,"end":63.328,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":16},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d81c3b87d_5-1a.jpg"}